{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55857","headline":"偈颂（幷序○序爲南岳齐己撰） 十四 · 居遁","name":"偈颂（幷序○序爲南岳齐己撰） 十四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"此生不息息何时，息在今生共要知。\n心息仙因（《景德传灯录》卷二九作「只缘」）无妄想，妄空（《景德传灯录》作「除」）心息是休时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"居遁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55857.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55857","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}